{title: Kaande Pohe}
{artist: Avdhoot Gupte Sunidhi Chauhan}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm]Bhijalelya ksha [G#]naanna,        [D#]athhawanichi [Cm]fodani
[Fm]Haladisaathhi [Cm]asusalele,        [C#]halawe man an [D#]kaanti
[Fm]Ayushy heeeeeeeeeeeeeee,        chuliwara [Cm]lyaaaaaaaaaaaa
kadhi [C#]talee [D#]eeeeeee,        kaande [Fm]poheeeeeeeeeeee
[Fm]Naatyaanchya ya [Cm]bajaratun,        [D#]wikretyaanchi [Fm]daati
[Fm]Ani mhane to [Cm]waracha thharwi,        [D#]shatajanmaachya [Fm]gaathhi
[Cm]Roj nataawe [D#]roj sajaawe,        dharun asha [Cm]khoti
[D#]Paane mituni [C#]laajaalupari,        [C]punha ughadanya [Fm]saathhi
[Fm]Ayushy heeeeeeeeeeeeeee,        chuliwara [Cm]lyaaaaaaaaaaaa
kadhi [C#]talee [D#]eeeeeee,        kaande [Fm]poheeeeeeeeeeee
[Fm]Dur deshichya [Cm]raajakumaaraa,        [C#]chi swapne [D#]paahataana
[Fm]Kunitari yaawe [Cm]haluch maagun,        [C#]dhyaani mani nasa [D#]taana
[Cm]Nakalat apan [D#]harawun jaawe,        [Cm]swaths mag [D#]japataana
[Cm]An mag dole [D#]ughadaawe he,        [C#]diwaaswapn [D#]paahataana
[Fm]Ayushy heeeeeeeeeeeeeee,        chuliwara [Cm]lyaaaaaaaaaaaa
kadhi [C#]talee [D#]eeeeeee,        kaande [Fm]poheeeeeeeeeeee
